# DigitalGuardian area 53, dg33 (spec digitalguardian_dg33_beacon.py): the beacon raised with the
# echo visor on (fn_14_28D0's 0x7F volume, emitter and collider natural), raised again with the
# sound handle and the collider already set, fn_14_2CC4's echo volume with the handle set, then
# its flag 0x08 early-out; fn_14_308C (ShouldJumpAttack) with waypoint 00350017 inactive.
@f130 layer 10; god 1; give EchoVisor
@f150 send e00350060 Activate; send e0035000f Activate
@f160 send e00350017 Deactivate
@f200 fsm e00350060 CrippledReaction
@f250 fsm e00350060 Crippled
@f255 visor echo
@f300 var e00350060 dg.beacon 2
@f380 var e00350060 dg.beacon; var e00350060 dg.beaconh; var e00350060 dg.jumptime 0; trigcall e00350060 ShouldJumpAttack
@f400 var e00350060 dg.beacon 2
@f440 var e00350060 dg.beacon; var e00350060 dg.jumptime 0; trigcall e00350060 ShouldJumpAttack
@f450 visor combat
@f470 var e00350060 dg.flags 8
@f500 var e00350060 dg.jumptime 0; trigcall e00350060 ShouldJumpAttack; var e00350060 dg.flags
@f520 covdump
